00:22:31.984 --> 00:22:33.686
It's morning!

00:22:33.686 --> 00:22:37.323
The evils from a hundred years
ago have begun to awaken!

00:22:37.723 --> 00:22:41.327
But this is getting crazier and crazier!

00:22:41.327 --> 00:22:43.629
What's gonna happen now?

00:22:43.963 --> 00:22:46.265
What will happen to Bo-bobo,
the remnant of the Hair Kingdom,

00:22:46.265 --> 00:22:48.868
and his friends?

00:22:50.336 --> 00:22:52.838
You saved my life...

00:22:53.105 --> 00:22:56.609
